        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkomelejiwa kūlomba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gwa kūmalīja badūgū, tūlombelagi, ū mhayo go ng'wa Seeba gūsambaale wangū, hangī gwinhwe ikūjo gīt'ūmo īkūjīlaga kū bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na gīkī tūpījiwe ū kū banhū a bibonya na a bahūnga; nguno a banhū batī bazunya pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Seeba īkī nsanyiwa, akūmuguzuhya na kūmulang'hana a bing'we ū kūlī ng'wanishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūlīnsanya Seeba gīkī īyo tūlīmukomeleja yenīyī mukwīyīta, na hangī mukwīta na kūtinda ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Seeba leki ajitongeele īng'holò jing'we mu būtogwa bo ng'wa Mulungu na mu wiyūmīlīja bo ng'wa Kilisito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhūgūji kūlwa boolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama tūlīmukomeleja badūgū mu lina lya ng'wa Seeba Yesu Kilisito gīkī, lekanagi nang'hwe būlī ndūgū ūyo alī na nhūngwa ja boolo, ūyo atūshimīzīlaga mu malange ayo ng'waganukūla kūfuma kū bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bing'we benekīlī mumanile gīkī shing'wigelile kūtūlondeela, īkī twalī tūtī boolo aho twalī hamò ning'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūtanukūlile shilīwa sha dalali kūfuma kūlī munhū ose ose, alīyo līīmi na būjikū twalwishaga milīmo midito, nguno twalī tūtatogilwe kūmuna nūūlū ūmò wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twītaga gīko ītī kūlwa kūbiza tūtī na būdūla bo kūlagīja, alīyo kūlwa nguno ya kwitūūla a bise kūbiza būlolelo wing'we, gīkī ning'we muyīta gīt'ūmo tūkwītīlaga a bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno na a haho twalī hamò ning'we tūkamuwīla gīkī, ūlū munhū atatogilwe kūtūmama milīmo, nū kūlya atizagūlya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twandije kwigwa gīkī bamò na bamò ū mu bing'we bakūjaga būsīngīja mu kaya ja banhū, ndūhū nūūlū kūtūmama nīmo; batī na gwabo gete ūlū ītī kūja bakwishatya shatyaga dūhū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a banhū ba mbika yenīyo tūlībakomeleja na kūbahūgūla mulī Seeba Yesu Kilisito balembeele, batūmame milīmo yabo; nabo bayipandīkīla shilīwa shabo benekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we badūgū, yaya ū kūgwang'holò ū kwīta ī yawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū aligele wa kūlema kūgwigwa ū mhayo gwise ūyo tūlīng'wandīkīla, mpambūkagi ū munhū ng'wenūyo, yaya nū kwisangīja nang'hwe, ading'we minala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike yaya ū kūnola gītī ng'wanishi, ng'ūng'hūgūla gītī ndūgū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya kūmalīja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Seeba wa mhola ang'winhe mhola mu yose gwa gwa gwa. Seeba abize hamò ning'we bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbū wene būgīsha mu nkono gwane nene Paulo ng'wenekīlī, hū lūmeng'ho ūlo nakūtūūlaga mu nyalūba jose; h'ūmo nakwandīkīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shigongo sha ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito shibize hamò ning'we bose pye. Alichene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
